steps where degrees disagrees with the model 400 graphs x 20 steps = 0 of 8000
steps where succ/pred disagrees with the model 400 graphs x 20 steps = 0 of 8000
steps where query disagrees with the model 400 graphs x 20 steps = 0 of 8000
steps where list disagrees with the model 400 graphs x 20 steps = 0 of 8000
steps where is_path disagrees with the model 400 graphs x 20 steps = 0 of 8000
steps where rev_postorder disagrees with the model 400 graphs x 20 steps = 0 of 8000
steps where postorder disagrees with the model 400 graphs x 20 steps = 0 of 8000
steps where full_rev_postorder disagrees with the model 400 graphs x 20 steps = 0 of 8000
steps where untouched disagrees with the model 400 graphs x 20 steps = 0 of 8000
add_edge twice: out_degree  = 1
then add_multi_edge: out_degree, in_degree  = 2 2
then delete_edge once: out_degree, query  = 1 true
delete_edge of an absent edge: out_degree b  = 0
is_path n n with no edges  = true
choose on an empty graph  = EXN Failure("choose")
find with no match  = EXN Not_found
fold (sum of infos)  = 1
filter (info > 0)  = [1]
coalesce a b where a>b: self-loop on a  = info 9 query true out 1
delete_node twice  = EXN Invalid_argument("list_remove in digraph.ml")
  then list  = [0]
coalesce a b where b>b: a's succ, pred  = [0] [0]
  pred holds the deleted node  = false
